---
description: Infrastructure adapters implementing application ports
globs: libs/infra/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# infra

- Implement ports from `@senbilan/core/application` (HTTP, mock, storage, observability).
- Map DTO ↔ domain in adapters; do not leak DTO types into features.
- `infra/mock`: local/dev only; selected when `APP_CONFIG.features.mockApi === true`.
- May use Angular `HttpClient`, MSW, Sentry, browser APIs — **not** feature UI.
- Do not import `libs/features/*` or `libs/entities/*`.
- Export only concrete adapters / providers via `src/index.ts`.
- Keep side effects here; keep rules in domain/use cases.
